---
description: SubQDocs frontend — API layer, routes registry, Redux, hooks, app shell
globs:
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/api/**/*
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/constants/**/*
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/contexts/**/*
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/helper/**/*
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/hooks/**/*
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/redux/**/*
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/routes/**/*
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/lib/**/*
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/services/**/*
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/types/**/*
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/utils/**/*
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/schema/**/*
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/main.tsx
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/App.tsx
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/App.css
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/index.css
  - subqdocs-frontend/src/vite-env.d.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

When editing API, routing, global state, or app entry, open [`docs/kb/subqdocs-frontend/INDEX.md`](../../docs/kb/subqdocs-frontend/INDEX.md), [`routing-and-state.md`](../../docs/kb/subqdocs-frontend/routing-and-state.md), or [`entry-points.md`](../../docs/kb/subqdocs-frontend/entry-points.md). Use typed `axios*` wrappers from `src/api/`; lazy loads via `lazyWithRetry()`. Cross-check [`docs/kb/subqdocs-backend/INDEX.md`](../../docs/kb/subqdocs-backend/INDEX.md) when changing API contracts.
